{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgwpTrzHUhsqVDQ7QMb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Decision: CR-9207 — Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The request**\n- Request ID: CR-9207\n- Customer: Acme Industrial Supply Co. (ERP C-1044, CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187)\n- Current limit: $50,000 | Requested: $500,000\n- Date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- Basis cited: \"Covered by the Acme parent guarantee\"\n\n**2. Customer identification**\nThere are two distinct Acme companies in the system:\n- **Acme Mfg. Holdings** (C-1001, CRM-2048, DUNS 04-812-7730) — Strategic account, Milwaukee, WI\n- **Acme Industrial Supply Co.** (C-1044, CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187) — Standard account, Akron, OH\n\nThe request is for Acme Industrial Supply Co., the Standard-tier account.\n\n**3. Credit support cited**\nThe request relies on the **Acme parent guarantee (GRT-ACME-2026)**. However:\n\n- **GRT-ACME-2026, Section 1** (Guaranteed party): \"The Guarantor guarantees the payment obligations to Northstar of its wholly owned subsidiary **Acme Mfg. Holdings**, doing business as Acme Manufacturing (\"Customer\")… **No other company is covered.**\"\n\n- **Support Schedule C** (SUP-ACME-C, covering Acme Mfg. Holdings): Explicitly states: \"Coverage does not extend to the Customer's parent, Acme Group Holdings, Inc., or to any other affiliate. **Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered.**\"\n\nThe guarantee does not cover Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n\n**4. Policy in effect**\nCREDIT-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-09-23)\n\n**5. Maximum credit limit and eligibility**\n- **Account tier:** Standard (per CRM-2091)\n- **Base maximum for Standard accounts:** $250,000 (CREDIT-POLICY-2026, section 5)\n- **Credit support that applies:** None (the guarantee is not applicable to this customer)\n- **Requested limit:** $500,000\n\n**The requested limit of $500,000 exceeds the maximum of $250,000 by $250,000.**\n\n**6. Payment history**\nNo invoices due within the 12 months before 2026-09-23 appear in the record for C-1044. (The two invoices on record are from early 2025, before the lookback window.) No late-payment issues.\n\n---\n\n## Outcome\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9207\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044, CRM-2091)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 50000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 500000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier; maximum $250,000 per CREDIT-POLICY-2026 section 5. Acme parent guarantee (GRT-ACME-2026) covers only Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001), not Acme Industrial Supply Co. Guarantee section 1 and support schedule explicitly exclude this company. Requested limit exceeds maximum by $250,000.\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"GRT-ACME-2026, section 1: Covers only Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001); explicitly states 'No other company is covered'\",\n    \"SUP-ACME-C: Acme parent support terms state 'Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered'\",\n    \"CRM-2091: Acme Industrial Supply Co. is Standard tier (not Strategic)\",\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 section 5: Maximum limit for Standard accounts is $250,000\",\n    \"erp_credit.csv: C-1044 current limit is $50,000\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"The requestor may have confused Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044, Standard account) with Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001, Strategic account). A concurrent request CR-9201 on the same date raises Acme Mfg. Holdings' limit with reference to the parent guarantee, which would be valid for that account. The parent guarantee does not apply to Acme Industrial Supply Co.\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen and Revenue team\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**The customer is not eligible for the requested limit. A higher approver cannot fix ineligibility; the requested limit exceeds the maximum allowable for a Standard account even before considering that the cited credit support does not apply to this customer.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25234,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25234},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"102279e2-baed-4461-a0bb-a5bf77e79969","uuid":"fa53546c-2803-450f-9a86-cc299bd76851","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:27:57.705Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgwpGiVZ3AApJxBNru9"}
